<title>USA: Teche asks to buy back 10 pct of its stock.</title>
<headline>Teche asks to buy back 10 pct of its stock.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN, La. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teche Holding Co said on Wednesday it asked the U.S. Office of Thrift Supervision for its &quot;non-objection&quot; to repurchase another 343,750, or 10 percent, of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it completed its previous repurchase plan, buying back 381,945 shares.</p>
<p>Teche said there were no assurances its request for another buyback would be granted.</p>
</text>
